rota lap 4574, row 4 -- Earth, the row that breathes in; the threshold page, the clock and the mark, TWO_ROOMS, the marked value. The reading gave the lap its shape: take the concrete fact at the door before the sentence about it. A REDS row's status marker is a mark worn at a seam, and %697 wore OPEN while its repair had already crossed.
think Opened cold at 20260910.125448 with a clean tree and 24 stashes standing; launched the roster detached rather than choosing a transcript name, per the baton's own clause.
think Reds-first read the pin: 16 rows, all OPEN, 40,771 of 40,960 bytes -- 189 free, so no red could be booked. Four ships have written that onto construction/ITINERARY.md as Keaton's word.
think Read %697's OPEN clause against the tree rather than believing it. It asked for a byte-floor on a newly tracked .kyri at the moment it is staged. tools/fixtures/e/empty_document_scan.sh already carries a staged mode and tools/hooks/pre-commit already runs it as rule eight; git log dates that landing at 71a85f8f7, 20260910.071421 -- forty-eight minutes after the row was booked.
think Proved the repair by running tools/fixtures/e/empty_document_control.sh before touching a byte: staged_refused, staged_named, staged_written_free, staged_peer_free all yes, 22 legs, control_verdict=ok.
think Accreted a closing clause onto the %697 paragraph ending in a bold BOOKED marker, since the ledger's law is that rows are never edited and a correction accretes. Wrote a shelf head and folded the row with tools/fixtures/r/reds_fold.sh; the recital line was written by the tool.
think Then read the capacity scan's own two lines against each other. pin_held_rows landed at 07:36 today reading 9 of 16, and the pin_deadlock_doors line printed one breath later still said no lawful fold exists and each of three doors is Keaton's word. Nine held means seven were not, and an unheld row is one the fleet may close. Diagnosis and prescription disagreed inside one instrument.
think Derived PIN_UNHELD as PIN_OPEN - PIN_HELD rather than counting a second population, printed it as pin_unheld_rows, and named it first in the doors line ahead of the three held doors.
think Proved both new readings by mutation: breaking the complement arithmetic failed three legs, reverting the doors wording failed one. The count leg then read its needle off the whole stream and stayed green against the reverted wording, so it reads the doors line alone now and fails with the other.
think Reds-first again on the cold pass's own red: mantra_tablecloth_query_wire read red at 20260910.125508 and green on re-run over the same bytes, tree_moved=no. Fifteen hand runs on that tree gave thirteen green and one red.
