obs The flap's cause is named as inference and not observation: two rye build calls into fixed tree paths on a pier running eight passes at once. No run has caught it in the act, so the row says so.
obs One flapping guard reddened two roster lines, since standing_equipment answers red_self whenever any rostered guard reds. Neither line says flap, which is why the row books the class rather than the instance.
